{"id":"f8284ae43439ae52","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-replacement-product.md","title":"平衡替换积的端口构造","display":"df-replacement-product — 平衡替换积的端口构造","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-replacement-product","aliases":["28-df-replacement-product"],"display":"df-replacement-product — 平衡替换积的端口构造","depends_on":["[[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]","[[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]"],"source_book_location":"§21.3.4; equation (21.9)","source_printed_pages":"436–437","source_pdf_pages":"462–463","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-replacement-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-replacement-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-replacement-product — 平衡替换积的端口构造"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b6b8966305e02a9\" href=\"?note=0b6b8966305e02a9\" title=\"28-df-regular-rotation-graph\">28-df-regular-rotation-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c9d3a0ba202211c\" href=\"?note=1c9d3a0ba202211c\" title=\"28-df-random-walk-matrix\">28-df-random-walk-matrix</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§21.3.4; equation (21.9)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"436–437"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"462–463"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,D,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(N,D,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\">\\(G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=(D,d,S)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{D,d}\">\\(H=(D,d,S)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{D,d}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0b6b8966305e02a9\" href=\"?note=0b6b8966305e02a9\" title=\"28-df-regular-rotation-graph\">28-df-regular-rotation-graph</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[a]=\\{1,\\ldots,a\\}\">\\([a]=\\{1,\\ldots,a\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,u&#39;\\in[N]\">\\(u,u&#39;\\in[N]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v,v&#39;\\in[D]\">\\(v,v&#39;\\in[D]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,i&#39;\\in[d]\">\\(i,i&#39;\\in[d]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_H\">\\(P_H\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1c9d3a0ba202211c\" href=\"?note=1c9d3a0ba202211c\" title=\"28-df-random-walk-matrix\">28-df-random-walk-matrix</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_N\">\\(I_N\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 阶单位矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\otimes\">\\(\\otimes\\)</span> 为矩阵 Kronecker 积。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_D,\\zeta,R_\\circledR,\\widehat R\">\\(\\eta_D,\\zeta,R_\\circledR,\\widehat R\\)</span> 由下式定义，所有矩阵行、列均使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_D\">\\(\\eta_D\\)</span> 编号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\eta_D:[N]\\times[D]\\to[ND],\\qquad\\eta_D(u,v)\\coloneqq(u-1)D+v.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\eta_D:[N]\\times[D]\\to[ND],\\qquad\\eta_D(u,v)\\coloneqq(u-1)D+v.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\zeta:[d]\\times\\{0,1\\}\\to[2d],\\qquad\\zeta(i,b)\\coloneqq2(i-1)+b+1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\zeta:[d]\\times\\{0,1\\}\\to[2d],\\qquad\\zeta(i,b)\\coloneqq2(i-1)+b+1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR_\\circledR(\\eta_D(u,v),\\zeta(i,0))&amp;\\coloneqq(\\eta_D(u,v&#39;),\\zeta(i&#39;,0))&amp;&amp;\\bigl(S(v,i)=(v&#39;,i&#39;)\\bigr),\\\\\nR_\\circledR(\\eta_D(u,v),\\zeta(i,1))&amp;\\coloneqq(\\eta_D(u&#39;,v&#39;),\\zeta(i,1))&amp;&amp;\\bigl(R(u,v)=(u&#39;,v&#39;)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR_\\circledR(\\eta_D(u,v),\\zeta(i,0))&amp;\\coloneqq(\\eta_D(u,v&#39;),\\zeta(i&#39;,0))&amp;&amp;\\bigl(S(v,i)=(v&#39;,i&#39;)\\bigr),\\\\\nR_\\circledR(\\eta_D(u,v),\\zeta(i,1))&amp;\\coloneqq(\\eta_D(u&#39;,v&#39;),\\zeta(i,1))&amp;&amp;\\bigl(R(u,v)=(u&#39;,v&#39;)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_\\circledR:[ND]\\times[2d]\\to[ND]\\times[2d],\\qquad R_\\circledR\\circ R_\\circledR=\\mathrm{id}_{[ND]\\times[2d]}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_\\circledR:[ND]\\times[2d]\\to[ND]\\times[2d],\\qquad R_\\circledR\\circ R_\\circledR=\\mathrm{id}_{[ND]\\times[2d]}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat R_{\\eta_D(u&#39;,v&#39;),\\eta_D(u,v)}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;R(u,v)=(u&#39;,v&#39;),\\\\0&amp;R(u,v)\\ne(u&#39;,v&#39;).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat R_{\\eta_D(u&#39;,v&#39;),\\eta_D(u,v)}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;R(u,v)=(u&#39;,v&#39;),\\\\0&amp;R(u,v)\\ne(u&#39;,v&#39;).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G\\mathbin{\\circledR}H\\coloneqq(ND,2d,R_\\circledR)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{ND,2d},\\qquad P_{G\\mathbin{\\circledR}H}=\\frac12\\widehat R+\\frac12(I_N\\otimes P_H).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G\\mathbin{\\circledR}H\\coloneqq(ND,2d,R_\\circledR)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{ND,2d},\\qquad P_{G\\mathbin{\\circledR}H}=\\frac12\\widehat R+\\frac12(I_N\\otimes P_H).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>b=0 在云内走 H，b=1 按大图旋转映射跨云；跨云边有 d 个平行端口，确保概率各半。这是书中的 balanced replacement product，并非只加一条跨云边的另一种替换积。两种分支各自对合且 b 不变，保证旋转映射良定义。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§21.3.4; equation (21.9)；印刷页 436–437；PDF 页 462–463。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-regular-rotation-graph","status":"resolved","id":"0b6b8966305e02a9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-random-walk-matrix","status":"resolved","id":"1c9d3a0ba202211c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-regular-rotation-graph","status":"resolved","id":"0b6b8966305e02a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$N,D,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$，$H=(D,d,S)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{D,d}$，见 [[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]。$[a]=\\{1,\\ldots,a\\}$；$u,u'\\in[N]$，$v,v'\\in[D]$，$i,i'\\in[d]$，$b\\in\\{0,1\\}$。\n$P_H$ 见 [[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]；$I_N$ 为 $N$ 阶单位矩阵，$\\otimes$ 为矩阵 Kronecker 积。$\\eta_D,\\zeta,R_\\circledR,\\widehat R$ 由下式定义，所有矩阵行、列均使用 $\\eta_D$ 编号。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-random-walk-matrix","status":"resolved","id":"1c9d3a0ba202211c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$N,D,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$，$H=(D,d,S)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{D,d}$，见 [[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]。$[a]=\\{1,\\ldots,a\\}$；$u,u'\\in[N]$，$v,v'\\in[D]$，$i,i'\\in[d]$，$b\\in\\{0,1\\}$。\n$P_H$ 见 [[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]；$I_N$ 为 $N$ 阶单位矩阵，$\\otimes$ 为矩阵 Kronecker 积。$\\eta_D,\\zeta,R_\\circledR,\\widehat R$ 由下式定义，所有矩阵行、列均使用 $\\eta_D$ 编号。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"N,D,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}","display":false},{"tex":"H=(D,d,S)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{D,d}","display":false},{"tex":"[a]=\\{1,\\ldots,a\\}","display":false},{"tex":"u,u'\\in[N]","display":false},{"tex":"v,v'\\in[D]","display":false},{"tex":"i,i'\\in[d]","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"P_H","display":false},{"tex":"I_N","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"\\otimes","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta_D,\\zeta,R_\\circledR,\\widehat R","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta_D:[N]\\times[D]\\to[ND],\\qquad\\eta_D(u,v)\\coloneqq(u-1)D+v.","display":true},{"tex":"\\zeta:[d]\\times\\{0,1\\}\\to[2d],\\qquad\\zeta(i,b)\\coloneqq2(i-1)+b+1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nR_\\circledR(\\eta_D(u,v),\\zeta(i,0))&\\coloneqq(\\eta_D(u,v'),\\zeta(i',0))&&\\bigl(S(v,i)=(v',i')\\bigr),\\\\\nR_\\circledR(\\eta_D(u,v),\\zeta(i,1))&\\coloneqq(\\eta_D(u',v'),\\zeta(i,1))&&\\bigl(R(u,v)=(u',v')\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"R_\\circledR:[ND]\\times[2d]\\to[ND]\\times[2d],\\qquad R_\\circledR\\circ R_\\circledR=\\mathrm{id}_{[ND]\\times[2d]}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat R_{\\eta_D(u',v'),\\eta_D(u,v)}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&R(u,v)=(u',v'),\\\\0&R(u,v)\\ne(u',v').\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"G\\mathbin{\\circledR}H\\coloneqq(ND,2d,R_\\circledR)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{ND,2d},\\qquad P_{G\\mathbin{\\circledR}H}=\\frac12\\widehat R+\\frac12(I_N\\otimes P_H).","display":true}],"bytes":2328,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-386","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-graph-power]]、[[28-df-graph-tensor-product]]、[[28-df-replacement-product]]、[[28-thm-tensor-product-expansion]]、[[28-thm-replacement-product-expansion]]、[[28-df-flat-source]]、[[28-lem-flat-source-convex-decomposition]]、[[28-df-branching-program]]、[[28-df-undirected-connectivity]]、[[28-thm-reingold]]、[[28-df-space-bounded-prg]]、[[28-thm-nisan-space-prg]]。"},{"id":"23862bee6d995eec","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)$、$H=(D,d,S)$ 与平衡替换积采用 [[28-df-replacement-product]]；$\\lambda$ 见 [[28-df-spectral-expander]]，$0<\\epsilon,\\delta\\le1$，$\\lambda(G)\\le1-\\epsilon$，$\\lambda(H)\\le1-\\delta$。"}],"outgoing":["0b6b8966305e02a9","1c9d3a0ba202211c"]}